  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam and Lily are in the park. They look. \"Let's count!\" says Sam. \"One bird,\" says Lily. \"Two birds!\" says Sam.",
      "Look at the water! \"Ducks!\" says Lily. \"One, two, three!\" says Sam. Three ducks. The ducks are happy. \"How many fish?\" asks Lily. \"One, two, three, four, five!\" \"Five fish!\" says Sam.",
      "Pip wants to count too. Pip runs to the water. \"Woof, woof, woof!\" says Pip. \"Three ducks!\" says Lily. \"Pip can count!\" says Sam. Good dog! They are friends. Pip is their friend too."
    ],
    "summary": "Sam and Lily count birds, ducks, and fish in the park. Pip wants to count too.",
